---
// Every guide table scrolls sideways inside its own box on narrow screens (WCAG 1.4.10 reflow), and the box is
// keyboard-focusable so it can be scrolled without a mouse (axe: scrollable-region-focusable).
---
<div class="table-wrap" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Table"><table><slot /></table></div>
